(1943632, 268297, 33352, '<td valign="top">I Find it hard to see the benefit of black &amp; white,in a challenge of this type,where the mood of the image is set by the glow an texture of the candle, am giving this an 8, as a lot of feeling is present.</td>', 'I Find it hard to see the benefit of black & white,in a challenge of this type,where the mood of the image is set by the glow an texture of the candle, am giving this an 8, as a lot of feeling is present.', '2005-12-12 01:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
