(1944020, 268063, 43463, '<td valign="top">A very minimilistic approach that works wonderfully. The main focus is the wick and the flame that appear to be adrift in a sea of blue with the darkness (the dark area in the upper 1/2 of the left hand side) threatening to extingush it. Lighting, composition, and subject are well captured.</td>', 'A very minimilistic approach that works wonderfully. The main focus is the wick and the flame that appear to be adrift in a sea of blue with the darkness (the dark area in the upper 1/2 of the left hand side) threatening to extingush it. Lighting, composition, and subject are well captured.', '2005-12-12 07:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944031, 267147, 43463, '<td valign="top">Composition, set-up, and lighting are all in fine tune to invoke the imagery presented here. The flame on the candle is in perfect focus and with it''s position in center of the frame it immediately captures the eye''s attention. The choice of the candle with red &amp; black burned wax running down the sides was excellent in creating the mood and further strengthening the connection to necromancy and/or satanic practices. The imagery is further strengthened by coupling the symbol of the stereotypical five pointed satanic symbol hovering behind and just above the flame from the candle. In the background we notice the hooded figure whose intense stare is leveled on the symbol and the flame.</td>', 'Composition, set-up, and lighting are all in fine tune to invoke the imagery presented here. The flame on the candle is in perfect focus and with it''s position in center of the frame it immediately captures the eye''s attention. The choice of the candle with red & black burned wax running down the sides was excellent in creating the mood and further strengthening the connection to necromancy and/or satanic practices. The imagery is further strengthened by coupling the symbol of the stereotypical five pointed satanic symbol hovering behind and just above the flame from the candle. In the background we notice the hooded figure whose intense stare is leveled on the symbol and the flame.', '2005-12-12 08:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944051, 267992, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of the composition. The eye naturally follows the trail of lights as they line the stairs. The slight sepia tone here gives it a feel of a time gone past - a good memory. As much as the sepia tone adds to the mood - I still wonder what the color version would have looked like. My only critique on this photo is that there appears to be another source of light or candle on the bottom left of the image. This not only distracts attention away from the main focus but also serves to break the visual linear trail of the candles lining the steps.</td>', 'Love the angle of the composition. The eye naturally follows the trail of lights as they line the stairs. The slight sepia tone here gives it a feel of a time gone past - a good memory. As much as the sepia tone adds to the mood - I still wonder what the color version would have looked like. My only critique on this photo is that there appears to be another source of light or candle on the bottom left of the image. This not only distracts attention away from the main focus but also serves to break the visual linear trail of the candles lining the steps.', '2005-12-12 08:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944055, 267147, 48812, '<td valign="top">Nice David''s Star</td>', 'Nice David''s Star', '2005-12-12 08:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944057, 266328, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really like the take of visually capturing the imagery of "a moth to a flame". The moth is very well light such that we can make out details on it''s wings, body and even attenae. I think the visual impact of the image would be strengthened  if the flame were more detailed in the shot. As it appears here it is overexposed and an undefined blob of light. Another area that could go a long ways to strengthening the wow factor would have been to illuminate the latern that holds the candle - seeing the details in that object too would add some more visual interest to hold the eye''s attention. Still, this is a well done shot.</td>', 'I really like the take of visually capturing the imagery of "a moth to a flame". The moth is very well light such that we can make out details on it''s wings, body and even attenae. I think the visual impact of the image would be strengthened  if the flame were more detailed in the shot. As it appears here it is overexposed and an undefined blob of light. Another area that could go a long ways to strengthening the wow factor would have been to illuminate the latern that holds the candle - seeing the details in that object too would add some more visual interest to hold the eye''s attention. Still, this is a well done shot.', '2005-12-12 08:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944070, 267762, 47377, '<td valign="top">not sure what to look at in this picture... it looks messy. 4</td>', 'not sure what to look at in this picture... it looks messy. 4', '2005-12-12 08:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944080, 265682, 47377, '<td valign="top">I think I would have prefered this with shoes on! sorry! 4</td>', 'I think I would have prefered this with shoes on! sorry! 4', '2005-12-12 08:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944081, 267926, 35545, '<td valign="top">You have a really nice still life of fruit and cheese at the right.  It''s tones are quite dark.  The white candle is a jarring note, and the wites around the flame are blown out.  I think you would have done better with a darker colored candle, and some editing around the flame so we could see it.</td>', 'You have a really nice still life of fruit and cheese at the right.  It''s tones are quite dark.  The white candle is a jarring note, and the wites around the flame are blown out.  I think you would have done better with a darker colored candle, and some editing around the flame so we could see it.', '2005-12-12 08:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944085, 268131, 35545, '<td valign="top">I guess the candles are lit, but it''s hard to tell on the white background.  Also, the candles aren''t all straight in their holders.</td>', 'I guess the candles are lit, but it''s hard to tell on the white background.  Also, the candles aren''t all straight in their holders.', '2005-12-12 08:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944090, 268252, 47377, '<td valign="top">I like this but the candles are slight slanted and I think it would improve the picture to striaghten it. also slightly less overall lighting would have made the candle light more athmospheric...</td>', 'I like this but the candles are slight slanted and I think it would improve the picture to striaghten it. also slightly less overall lighting would have made the candle light more athmospheric...', '2005-12-12 08:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
