(1944130, 268297, 21714, '<td valign="top">Good work. Love the way you have used the model and the candle to light the shot. <br/>Looks like there''s movement around the face, and I think without that it would be even stronger. I am not against blur or anything, but just how I feel about the blur on this one.</td>', 'Good work. Love the way you have used the model and the candle to light the shot. Looks like there''s movement around the face, and I think without that it would be even stronger. I am not against blur or anything, but just how I feel about the blur on this one.', '2005-12-12 08:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944137, 267004, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like how you have used the candle and brought out the details in the hands. Very good work. It does appear to be slightly heavier to the right because of the the angle of the candle and hands, which is not really a problem .. That''s only something someone who''s picky like me would notice. <br/>Well done.<br/></td>', 'I like how you have used the candle and brought out the details in the hands. Very good work. It does appear to be slightly heavier to the right because of the the angle of the candle and hands, which is not really a problem .. That''s only something someone who''s picky like me would notice. Well done.', '2005-12-12 09:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
