(1944404, 267871, 21604, '<td valign="top">Technically a good shot, I feel that it goes away from the challenge a bit though, it should be the candlelight that creates the impact of the shot, not a strobe and bullet. Having said that I think its a great shot so 6.</td>', 'Technically a good shot, I feel that it goes away from the challenge a bit though, it should be the candlelight that creates the impact of the shot, not a strobe and bullet. Having said that I think its a great shot so 6.', '2005-12-12 11:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
