(1944604, 267483, 35720, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, sharp with large DOF and good b&amp;w tone. And it also makes it interesting that there is just one candlelight. Great work!</td>', 'Simple and effective, sharp with large DOF and good b&w tone. And it also makes it interesting that there is just one candlelight. Great work!', '2005-12-12 12:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
