(1944824, 267496, 49102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful catch of sight on the wick of the candle, beautiful details quite clear</td>', 'Beautiful catch of sight on the wick of the candle, beautiful details quite clear', '2005-12-12 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944825, 266869, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion - <i> "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo."</i>.  Criticism; unless the quality suffered, this at 640 would have been much better in my opinion.  Assume those are reflections/refractions on each ''corner'' of the candle holder and a long exposure causing the ''rays''.  Seems ''almost'' perfectly symmetrical, so well done.  Not sure on the frame, especially ''color'', doesn''t enhance or add to the overall ''feel'' to this shot, again, in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion -  "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo.".  Criticism; unless the quality suffered, this at 640 would have been much better in my opinion.  Assume those are reflections/refractions on each ''corner'' of the candle holder and a long exposure causing the ''rays''.  Seems ''almost'' perfectly symmetrical, so well done.  Not sure on the frame, especially ''color'', doesn''t enhance or add to the overall ''feel'' to this shot, again, in my opinion.', '2005-12-12 14:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944841, 268223, 49102, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition, the image is well balanced, but I find the light a little too red</td>', 'beautiful composition, the image is well balanced, but I find the light a little too red', '2005-12-12 14:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944847, 266717, 49102, '<td valign="top">very beautiful like composition and research, it is a pity a little which the right side of the image is too dark</td>', 'very beautiful like composition and research, it is a pity a little which the right side of the image is too dark', '2005-12-12 14:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944870, 267553, 24013, '<td valign="top">beautiful warmth and composition</td>', 'beautiful warmth and composition', '2005-12-12 14:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944893, 267901, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion - <i> "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo."</i>.  Criticism; whilst I can see that you have made a good effort here, the biggest ''detractor'' here in my opinion is the decorative/accent tiling, so either a different crop after a nudge rotation up on the right perhaps, or else a different angle/perspective.  The colors are nice, the shadow play is also nice (especially in the water), which also, in my opinion, is another reason why perhaps a different angle/perspective would have made this even better.  Good potential.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion -  "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo.".  Criticism; whilst I can see that you have made a good effort here, the biggest ''detractor'' here in my opinion is the decorative/accent tiling, so either a different crop after a nudge rotation up on the right perhaps, or else a different angle/perspective.  The colors are nice, the shadow play is also nice (especially in the water), which also, in my opinion, is another reason why perhaps a different angle/perspective would have made this even better.  Good potential.', '2005-12-12 14:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944923, 267478, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like this clock.  It looks like a very interesting subject.  I think the yellow of the candle is a bit too bright in contrast to the rest of the image.</td>', 'I like this clock.  It looks like a very interesting subject.  I think the yellow of the candle is a bit too bright in contrast to the rest of the image.', '2005-12-12 15:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944924, 266869, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry and the novel effect made by looking down on the candle.</td>', 'I love the symmetry and the novel effect made by looking down on the candle.', '2005-12-12 15:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944947, 267049, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion - <i> "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo."</i>.  Criticism; whilst I like the concept (including use of color/pink(s)), this has more potential in my opinion. edit:removed ''unhelpful comments'', sorry you did not find my comments helpful<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-19 19:01:15.</i></td>', '6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion -  "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo.".  Criticism; whilst I like the concept (including use of color/pink(s)), this has more potential in my opinion. edit:removed ''unhelpful comments'', sorry you did not find my comments helpful', '2005-12-12 15:11:46.000000', '2005-12-19 19:01:15.000000', 1),
(1944952, 266853, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion - <i> "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo."</i>.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a tighter/more selective crop at the top and more ''enhancing'' of the ''lights'', somehow (camera dependent perhaps), may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion -  "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo.".  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a tighter/more selective crop at the top and more ''enhancing'' of the ''lights'', somehow (camera dependent perhaps), may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-12 15:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944956, 267762, 24013, '<td valign="top">lots of interesting stuff to look at in this.  love the colours and composition.</td>', 'lots of interesting stuff to look at in this.  love the colours and composition.', '2005-12-12 15:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944969, 266891, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion - <i> "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo."</i>.  Criticism; needs 640 (in this case width), there is also pixelation/jpeg loss/something in your shot so perhaps experimenting with your editing software learning about compression and image resizing will help you in the future.  I can''t quite discern what is at the background, fabric perhaps, so unfortunately I cannot even offer any suggestions as I can''t make out the potential.  What I can however see is that you have used ".. candlelight to create the impact of your photo.", however the size and quality need attention.</td>', '2 - Met the Challenge quite well in my opinion -  "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo.".  Criticism; needs 640 (in this case width), there is also pixelation/jpeg loss/something in your shot so perhaps experimenting with your editing software learning about compression and image resizing will help you in the future.  I can''t quite discern what is at the background, fabric perhaps, so unfortunately I cannot even offer any suggestions as I can''t make out the potential.  What I can however see is that you have used ".. candlelight to create the impact of your photo.", however the size and quality need attention.', '2005-12-12 15:21:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1944983, 267861, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Met the Challenge fairly well in my opinion - <i> "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo."</i>.  Criticism; attention to minor things like the wax/candle not ''seated'' properly in the foreground candle, the cropping and the one/two ''small spectrums'' in the upper left.  Perhaps a variation in angle/perspective and a slightly different composition (the bottom left candle is not as noticeable as the others), and possibly allowing more visible context/base (looks like little stands on a mirror or such, but the full effect/potential has not been achieved in my opinion) may have made this better, again,  in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Met the Challenge fairly well in my opinion -  "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo.".  Criticism; attention to minor things like the wax/candle not ''seated'' properly in the foreground candle, the cropping and the one/two ''small spectrums'' in the upper left.  Perhaps a variation in angle/perspective and a slightly different composition (the bottom left candle is not as noticeable as the others), and possibly allowing more visible context/base (looks like little stands on a mirror or such, but the full effect/potential has not been achieved in my opinion) may have made this better, again,  in my opinion.', '2005-12-12 15:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944996, 266313, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Met the Challenge fairly well in my opinion - <i> "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo."</i>.  Criticism; attention to choice of flowers (including arrangement of) to ''complement'' the candle ''theme'' (in this case a sunflower) and colors, choice of bowl/dish, surrounding ''elements'' (which all detract in my opinion), ''using'' the shadow play more, ''composing'' your shot/placement of the bowl/dish differently or else a different angle/persective (this looks too ''front on/snapshottish'') and, lastly, a tripod or ''make do one'', would all have made this much better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Met the Challenge fairly well in my opinion -  "Use candlelight to create the impact of your photo.".  Criticism; attention to choice of flowers (including arrangement of) to ''complement'' the candle ''theme'' (in this case a sunflower) and colors, choice of bowl/dish, surrounding ''elements'' (which all detract in my opinion), ''using'' the shadow play more, ''composing'' your shot/placement of the bowl/dish differently or else a different angle/persective (this looks too ''front on/snapshottish'') and, lastly, a tripod or ''make do one'', would all have made this much better in my opinion.', '2005-12-12 15:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1945051, 268221, 35720, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done. I like the lighting and the shadows on the wall. Good luck!</td>', 'This is nicely done. I like the lighting and the shadows on the wall. Good luck!', '2005-12-12 16:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
