(1946631, 267148, 21604, '<td valign="top">Ouch - looks painful, reminds me of that Madonna film.  I like the composition and the candle definitely creates an impact! 8.</td>', 'Ouch - looks painful, reminds me of that Madonna film.  I like the composition and the candle definitely creates an impact! 8.', '2005-12-13 09:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946632, 267384, 49102, '<td valign="top">The title of the photograph is quite selected because there are too many black zones well, there is an imbalance in the composition.</td>', 'The title of the photograph is quite selected because there are too many black zones well, there is an imbalance in the composition.', '2005-12-13 09:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946634, 267625, 21604, '<td valign="top">I think it stretches the theme a little.  The lighting doesn''t really create an impact, just a shot late at night.  Technically you have done well to capture the detail.  There looks to be some distortion to the right of the building, looks as if it is falling over a bit and could be a bit sharper too.</td>', 'I think it stretches the theme a little.  The lighting doesn''t really create an impact, just a shot late at night.  Technically you have done well to capture the detail.  There looks to be some distortion to the right of the building, looks as if it is falling over a bit and could be a bit sharper too.', '2005-12-13 09:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946636, 268063, 21604, '<td valign="top">Great shot - my fav of the challenge. Love the simplicity and the nice reflection created. 10.</td>', 'Great shot - my fav of the challenge. Love the simplicity and the nice reflection created. 10.', '2005-12-13 09:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
