(1946653, 266570, 21604, '<td valign="top">I quite like this shot, it gives more of a feel to it than showing detail.  Its has a nice dream like quality.</td>', 'I quite like this shot, it gives more of a feel to it than showing detail.  Its has a nice dream like quality.', '2005-12-13 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
