(1946657, 266863, 21604, '<td valign="top">Nice pose by the child.  Could have done with using more candles for the lighting as its a bit too dark on my monitor. Also its a bit too soft in the focus.</td>', 'Nice pose by the child.  Could have done with using more candles for the lighting as its a bit too dark on my monitor. Also its a bit too soft in the focus.', '2005-12-13 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
