(1946800, 267567, 47117, '<td valign="top">I have no clue what this is, and I see no candlelight.  It would have been nice to see you take the initiative of the contest and actually have a candle in the photo.  It is hard to take photos of candlelight, and those that didn''t give it a try I voted way down. Sorry.</td>', 'I have no clue what this is, and I see no candlelight.  It would have been nice to see you take the initiative of the contest and actually have a candle in the photo.  It is hard to take photos of candlelight, and those that didn''t give it a try I voted way down. Sorry.', '2005-12-13 10:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
