(1947013, 266891, 22379, '<td valign="top">This image is far to small to be judged fairly. Please consider using a larger image size in the future. It appears to be a webcam image  to judge by the quality. The grain is very predominant. If you are able to, try experimenting with the ISO on your camera. There does not appear to be any sharpness to the image. The 1/4 of black is adding little to the composition.</td>', 'This image is far to small to be judged fairly. Please consider using a larger image size in the future. It appears to be a webcam image  to judge by the quality. The grain is very predominant. If you are able to, try experimenting with the ISO on your camera. There does not appear to be any sharpness to the image. The 1/4 of black is adding little to the composition.', '2005-12-13 12:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947016, 267187, 49102, '<td valign="top">beautiful realization, good composition, the hot point (red) of the wick is on a gold point. Beautiful environment</td>', 'beautiful realization, good composition, the hot point (red) of the wick is on a gold point. Beautiful environment', '2005-12-13 12:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947017, 267836, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea but it looks a bit overprocessed.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea but it looks a bit overprocessed.', '2005-12-13 12:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947019, 268257, 44924, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for the hand in the picture I would give it a 10 for sure. Still a great idea.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for the hand in the picture I would give it a 10 for sure. Still a great idea.', '2005-12-13 12:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947020, 266730, 22379, '<td valign="top">I done not find this image photographically or visually appealling. It is shadow and blown out chunks with very little information inbetween. What is the subject? Certainly there is impact from candle light, but not the kind that  creates a strong image.  What is the redish brown thing in the right bottom corner and why is it there?</td>', 'I done not find this image photographically or visually appealling. It is shadow and blown out chunks with very little information inbetween. What is the subject? Certainly there is impact from candle light, but not the kind that  creates a strong image.  What is the redish brown thing in the right bottom corner and why is it there?', '2005-12-13 12:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947021, 268144, 49102, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject, clearness in general is good, what misses is the clearness of the flame and an adequate opening</td>', 'beautiful subject, clearness in general is good, what misses is the clearness of the flame and an adequate opening', '2005-12-13 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947024, 266890, 22379, '<td valign="top">This image is heavily out of focus and movement blur is apparent. It looks like the candle you have used may have had some visual appeal if the blur wasn''t present. It was not necessary that you used a single flame as your only light source.  Painting with light would have vastly improved this image, as i believe with better light managedment - this would have beena far stronger image.</td>', 'This image is heavily out of focus and movement blur is apparent. It looks like the candle you have used may have had some visual appeal if the blur wasn''t present. It was not necessary that you used a single flame as your only light source.  Painting with light would have vastly improved this image, as i believe with better light managedment - this would have beena far stronger image.', '2005-12-13 12:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
