(1947041, 266189, 22379, '<td valign="top">I am open to OOTB thinking but this is not OOTB this is "if i titled this just right i can find an excuse for including it in the challenge". The sun is not candlelight. It is a ball of gas. Sometimes it is better to just sit out.</td>', 'I am open to OOTB thinking but this is not OOTB this is "if i titled this just right i can find an excuse for including it in the challenge". The sun is not candlelight. It is a ball of gas. Sometimes it is better to just sit out.', '2005-12-13 12:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
