(1947273, 267147, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>First you got my high vote. This image displays a strong visual dark beauty. However, there is a glaring esoteric error here. White magicians use it in this postion while the black magicians employed it upside down. The topic of necromancy considered negative and dark will want to see the pentacle inverted.<br/> <br/>Returning for final bump given for expert exposure with candle and flame.</td>', 'Returning for comment.First you got my high vote. This image displays a strong visual dark beauty. However, there is a glaring esoteric error here. White magicians use it in this postion while the black magicians employed it upside down. The topic of necromancy considered negative and dark will want to see the pentacle inverted. Returning for final bump given for expert exposure with candle and flame.', '2005-12-13 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947289, 265599, 22379, '<td valign="top">although technically stronger than a lot of the images in this challege, there is little to no visual appeal here. This is the kind of view we see in the shower every day. The images needed something beyond the mundane added to it to give it some impact with the viewer.</td>', 'although technically stronger than a lot of the images in this challege, there is little to no visual appeal here. This is the kind of view we see in the shower every day. The images needed something beyond the mundane added to it to give it some impact with the viewer.', '2005-12-13 14:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947295, 265630, 22379, '<td valign="top">In viewing this image, i ask myself, why was it composed at this angle? What purpose does the black red wall serve in the image? All these candles in these very interesting stands must have been there for a reason, but there is no explination in the image. This is an image of candls rather than impact via candlelight. <br/></td>', 'In viewing this image, i ask myself, why was it composed at this angle? What purpose does the black red wall serve in the image? All these candles in these very interesting stands must have been there for a reason, but there is no explination in the image. This is an image of candls rather than impact via candlelight. ', '2005-12-13 14:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947344, 268160, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Using the candles to frame around the perimeter of the photo worked very well.  Leaves the photo feeling very balanced.  Great photo!</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Using the candles to frame around the perimeter of the photo worked very well.  Leaves the photo feeling very balanced.  Great photo!', '2005-12-13 14:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947353, 268053, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  The choice of positioning of the candles, makes for a very nice composition.</td>', 'Great photo!  The choice of positioning of the candles, makes for a very nice composition.', '2005-12-13 14:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947355, 268063, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is definatel minimalism at its best.  Great photo, love everything about it.</td>', 'This is definatel minimalism at its best.  Great photo, love everything about it.', '2005-12-13 14:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947362, 266869, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is a very unique and imaginative angle.  It definately makes for an excellent photo!</td>', 'This is a very unique and imaginative angle.  It definately makes for an excellent photo!', '2005-12-13 14:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947364, 267553, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very artsy take on the use of candle light.  Your composition and lighting work well.  Excellent photo!</td>', 'Very artsy take on the use of candle light.  Your composition and lighting work well.  Excellent photo!', '2005-12-13 14:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947394, 266368, 8139, '<td valign="top">Rubin?</td>', 'Rubin?', '2005-12-13 15:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947440, 268299, 9111, '<td valign="top">NIce idea.. bad posing.   She looks uncomfortable not passionate.  Her shoulder is up near her chin,  if you''d posed her with a small pillow under her right shoulder and  changed camera positions this might have worked better.</td>', 'NIce idea.. bad posing.   She looks uncomfortable not passionate.  Her shoulder is up near her chin,  if you''d posed her with a small pillow under her right shoulder and  changed camera positions this might have worked better.', '2005-12-13 15:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947474, 268235, 45933, '<td valign="top">i love the warm glow of the orange tones.  Nice composition.</td>', 'i love the warm glow of the orange tones.  Nice composition.', '2005-12-13 15:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947476, 268063, 45933, '<td valign="top">aw. this photo beautifully casts a sad/lonely feeling.  I love the gradient of colors.</td>', 'aw. this photo beautifully casts a sad/lonely feeling.  I love the gradient of colors.', '2005-12-13 15:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947480, 267680, 45933, '<td valign="top">WOW. nice color contrasts of the lit paper bags &amp; the darkness of the night.  Beautiful focus &amp; idea of photo.</td>', 'WOW. nice color contrasts of the lit paper bags & the darkness of the night.  Beautiful focus & idea of photo.', '2005-12-13 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947481, 267737, 45933, '<td valign="top">the grainy resolution adds a nice touch to this photo.  nice job.</td>', 'the grainy resolution adds a nice touch to this photo.  nice job.', '2005-12-13 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947489, 267666, 45933, '<td valign="top">haha! i like how this is a bit humorous &amp; a nice abstract photo.  it reminds me of a fried egg.  somehow, i have a difficult time imagining the center as a candle.</td>', 'haha! i like how this is a bit humorous & a nice abstract photo.  it reminds me of a fried egg.  somehow, i have a difficult time imagining the center as a candle.', '2005-12-13 15:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
