(1948948, 268283, 35321, '<td valign="top">Very Christmasy, though not very candley. ;-)  It''s a bit dark and the focus is a bit soft, but I like the composition and like that you used black-and-white.  You might want to experiment with PhotoShop (or equivalent) to try to artificially sharpen the image some, and perhaps adjust intensity levels to whiten Santa''s beard up a bit. :-)</td>', 'Very Christmasy, though not very candley. ;-)  It''s a bit dark and the focus is a bit soft, but I like the composition and like that you used black-and-white.  You might want to experiment with PhotoShop (or equivalent) to try to artificially sharpen the image some, and perhaps adjust intensity levels to whiten Santa''s beard up a bit. :-)', '2005-12-13 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
