(1950660, 268030, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the bokeh and the way that the highlights are distorted by the glass. I find the item in the lower left corner a little distracting. Perhaps this area could have been darkened.</td>', 'I like the bokeh and the way that the highlights are distorted by the glass. I find the item in the lower left corner a little distracting. Perhaps this area could have been darkened.', '2005-12-14 11:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
