(1951091, 267926, 22379, '<td valign="top">The focus seems fuzzy on the candle and beads but sharp around the pears. I personally would have zoomed out a bit, allowing  for more of the sheet as it is providing an interesting texture. Also i would have wanted to include the loops of the beads instead of cutting them off anround the candles plate.</td>', 'The focus seems fuzzy on the candle and beads but sharp around the pears. I personally would have zoomed out a bit, allowing  for more of the sheet as it is providing an interesting texture. Also i would have wanted to include the loops of the beads instead of cutting them off anround the candles plate.', '2005-12-14 13:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
