(1952888, 268299, 34217, '<td valign="top">This pose is not very flatering to your model.  and your light is not dramatic enough not and it is very obvious that she is not being lit by the candles.  I would have let that slip if the light was really amazing but it is kinda boring.  It would have been nice to see more shadow.  Plus it is never pretty to be able so see up someone nostrils keep that in mind when you are photogaphing people.  Fine art nudes are bery hard to do well.  Keep at it, good try</td>', 'This pose is not very flatering to your model.  and your light is not dramatic enough not and it is very obvious that she is not being lit by the candles.  I would have let that slip if the light was really amazing but it is kinda boring.  It would have been nice to see more shadow.  Plus it is never pretty to be able so see up someone nostrils keep that in mind when you are photogaphing people.  Fine art nudes are bery hard to do well.  Keep at it, good try', '2005-12-14 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
