(1953768, 266891, 26255, '<td valign="top">Image is way too small and pixelated.  The image itself appears to have potential, but it''s simply too hard to see.  This site has some good tutorials on how to resize images for posting.  Keep shooting.</td>', 'Image is way too small and pixelated.  The image itself appears to have potential, but it''s simply too hard to see.  This site has some good tutorials on how to resize images for posting.  Keep shooting.', '2005-12-15 11:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1953773, 267148, 26255, '<td valign="top">Ah yes... I was wondering when I was going to see the ole candlewax drip trick...  Good idea, but I think the execution is somewhat lacking.  The sensuality is lost in the composition.</td>', 'Ah yes... I was wondering when I was going to see the ole candlewax drip trick...  Good idea, but I think the execution is somewhat lacking.  The sensuality is lost in the composition.', '2005-12-15 11:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
