(1953927, 267950, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like your use of perspective.  I might have preferred this photo with a little more contrast.  It looks a little washed out on my screen.  Great idea to have the close up shot of the ornament and then tree way in the background.</td>', 'I like your use of perspective.  I might have preferred this photo with a little more contrast.  It looks a little washed out on my screen.  Great idea to have the close up shot of the ornament and then tree way in the background.', '2005-12-15 12:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
