(1954920, 266891, 39429, '<td valign="top">The concept is charming and well composed.  The technical quality of the image is very poor and keeps this from being much higher.  My first thought was a 1 or 2, but the charm of the piece brings it up to a 4.  View the tutorials to receive help on sizing and preparing for challenges.  Good luck in the future.</td>', 'The concept is charming and well composed.  The technical quality of the image is very poor and keeps this from being much higher.  My first thought was a 1 or 2, but the charm of the piece brings it up to a 4.  View the tutorials to receive help on sizing and preparing for challenges.  Good luck in the future.', '2005-12-15 20:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954926, 268296, 39429, '<td valign="top">Either the figures are tiny or the flames are huge.  I look forward to seeing this later and finding out which.</td>', 'Either the figures are tiny or the flames are huge.  I look forward to seeing this later and finding out which.', '2005-12-15 20:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
