(1954940, 267147, 39429, '<td valign="top">While I personally don''t like the subject matter, the image is very well done.  The DOF works well, as does the candle light glow.</td>', 'While I personally don''t like the subject matter, the image is very well done.  The DOF works well, as does the candle light glow.', '2005-12-15 20:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
