(1957465, 266996, 29269, '<td valign="top">This image is supposed to convey the feeling of ultimate relaxation, or that''s what I would hope for in a situation like this. However, your model''s posture does not seem to be the most comfortable one. The shoulders are a bit too high for comfort. Still, nice topic for the challenge, very tastefully done, with the just right DOF. I''d like to see it with more stooped shoulders (if and when you get a chance). Would make a whole point or two difference. 7.</td>', 'This image is supposed to convey the feeling of ultimate relaxation, or that''s what I would hope for in a situation like this. However, your model''s posture does not seem to be the most comfortable one. The shoulders are a bit too high for comfort. Still, nice topic for the challenge, very tastefully done, with the just right DOF. I''d like to see it with more stooped shoulders (if and when you get a chance). Would make a whole point or two difference. 7.', '2005-12-16 22:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957469, 267133, 29269, '<td valign="top">It seems that while the candlelight does add in a positive way to the illumination of the scene, there is another rather strong backlight behind buddha''s back that does not seem to be helping the candlelight imagery. In other words, having darker backdrop light would have helped this photo in my opinion. 6.</td>', 'It seems that while the candlelight does add in a positive way to the illumination of the scene, there is another rather strong backlight behind buddha''s back that does not seem to be helping the candlelight imagery. In other words, having darker backdrop light would have helped this photo in my opinion. 6.', '2005-12-16 22:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957496, 267537, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice mood. However, has a sense of lack of contrast. If it:<br/>1) had more contrast, (without blowing highlights) and<br/>2) did not have the towels that are disracting clutter to me,<br/>it would have been a serious contender for a ribbon. 7.</td>', 'Nice mood. However, has a sense of lack of contrast. If it:1) had more contrast, (without blowing highlights) and2) did not have the towels that are disracting clutter to me,it would have been a serious contender for a ribbon. 7.', '2005-12-16 23:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957504, 268299, 29269, '<td valign="top">This image has great potential but it will fail to ribbon for the following reasons:<br/>1) it has breasts (which are beautifully shaped, but controversial enough @ DPC)<br/>2) the left hand is bent in the wrist in a funny way<br/>3) the neck and the head do not appear to belong with the rest of the body.<br/>Another suggestion for improvement: there is either a shadow or visible pants near the waist line. You could have cropped these, to leave more to imagination.<br/> <br/>And whatever you do in the future, don''t act on my suggestion #1.</td>', 'This image has great potential but it will fail to ribbon for the following reasons:1) it has breasts (which are beautifully shaped, but controversial enough @ DPC)2) the left hand is bent in the wrist in a funny way3) the neck and the head do not appear to belong with the rest of the body.Another suggestion for improvement: there is either a shadow or visible pants near the waist line. You could have cropped these, to leave more to imagination. And whatever you do in the future, don''t act on my suggestion #1.', '2005-12-16 23:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
