(1957978, 267949, 49102, '<td valign="top">this lighting emphasizes the plant very well, color pleasant data by the red of bricks and the green spot of the plant. Beautiful composition, beautiful clearness.</td>', 'this lighting emphasizes the plant very well, color pleasant data by the red of bricks and the green spot of the plant. Beautiful composition, beautiful clearness.', '2005-12-17 09:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957986, 268029, 49102, '<td valign="top">Is the smile merry or sad? By seeing all the blur of this photograph I would say that it was sad and that the eyes were filled with tears. Certain artists make pass the blur like a criterion accademic, but not being an artist here the blur remains blur</td>', 'Is the smile merry or sad? By seeing all the blur of this photograph I would say that it was sad and that the eyes were filled with tears. Certain artists make pass the blur like a criterion accademic, but not being an artist here the blur remains blur', '2005-12-17 09:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957989, 267846, 49102, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful lighting, it illuminates the face very well and gives a calm and pensive atmosphere.</td>', 'Very beautiful lighting, it illuminates the face very well and gives a calm and pensive atmosphere.', '2005-12-17 09:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957992, 266725, 49102, '<td valign="top">The face east can be lit a little too much by this candle, as well as the hands. But very good idea. Clearness is good but in the eyes one sees sources of light. The composition is good.</td>', 'The face east can be lit a little too much by this candle, as well as the hands. But very good idea. Clearness is good but in the eyes one sees sources of light. The composition is good.', '2005-12-17 09:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957994, 268257, 32033, '<td valign="top">I thought of doing something like this.  I like your shot</td>', 'I thought of doing something like this.  I like your shot', '2005-12-17 09:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957998, 267519, 49102, '<td valign="top">beautiful work on the left of the photograph but what this does it pass on the line? The black is invading and creates pretty unbalances</td>', 'beautiful work on the left of the photograph but what this does it pass on the line? The black is invading and creates pretty unbalances', '2005-12-17 09:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958005, 267682, 32033, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure</td>', 'Very good exposure', '2005-12-17 09:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958013, 266929, 32033, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo.  Now for the bad,  Although the lighting is very good one can tell there is more than just the candlelight.  Very nice setup</td>', 'This is a very good photo.  Now for the bad,  Although the lighting is very good one can tell there is more than just the candlelight.  Very nice setup', '2005-12-17 09:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958027, 266996, 47852, '<td valign="top">The womans body seems very unnaturally positioned.  Gives me more of a feeling of a crime scene about to be investigated than a relaxing bath.</td>', 'The womans body seems very unnaturally positioned.  Gives me more of a feeling of a crime scene about to be investigated than a relaxing bath.', '2005-12-17 10:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958068, 268131, 23913, '<td valign="top">looks to be a little over smoothed with neat image or a like app...<br/>also the candles are tiped in different directions making it slightly awkward to view in the setup u have staged.<br/>over all a nice set tho and a very pleasing choice of colors to have (the gold and all) i just think that the candlelight isn''t the mian point of your image and it should have more of a point IMO to produce a higher score....at least from me.</td>', 'looks to be a little over smoothed with neat image or a like app...also the candles are tiped in different directions making it slightly awkward to view in the setup u have staged.over all a nice set tho and a very pleasing choice of colors to have (the gold and all) i just think that the candlelight isn''t the mian point of your image and it should have more of a point IMO to produce a higher score....at least from me.', '2005-12-17 10:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958072, 265599, 23913, '<td valign="top">a little to washed out for my tast...the over ex. point it to vast and the water drops arn''t exactly in focus they appear to be ever so slightly out</td>', 'a little to washed out for my tast...the over ex. point it to vast and the water drops arn''t exactly in focus they appear to be ever so slightly out', '2005-12-17 10:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958077, 268169, 23913, '<td valign="top">this image would greatly benifit from less saturation (IMO) also the girls stare is very odd, looks almost as if she having a staring contest with the candle''s flame....it both draws attention to the candle in a good way and puts (pun not intended) a negitive light upon the girl. I think this would be alot better after a re shoot and a propper WB adjustment, with less over all sat.</td>', 'this image would greatly benifit from less saturation (IMO) also the girls stare is very odd, looks almost as if she having a staring contest with the candle''s flame....it both draws attention to the candle in a good way and puts (pun not intended) a negitive light upon the girl. I think this would be alot better after a re shoot and a propper WB adjustment, with less over all sat.', '2005-12-17 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958081, 268301, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is nice and calming....<br/>the lighting is 2 different colors tho which kinda is bothering to my eye...maybe using mirror as a fill to only light the subject with the true candle light....don''t know could be very affect that way....GL</td>', 'this is nice and calming....the lighting is 2 different colors tho which kinda is bothering to my eye...maybe using mirror as a fill to only light the subject with the true candle light....don''t know could be very affect that way....GL', '2005-12-17 10:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958086, 267104, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is nice and graphic..the red white and black. u know your color sceams alright...<br/> <br/>this is my highest voted so far and i think the only thing wrong to my eye is -the wine glass sits slightly to the viewers right and this wouldn''t matter much but the candles are there as a judging point</td>', 'this is nice and graphic..the red white and black. u know your color sceams alright... this is my highest voted so far and i think the only thing wrong to my eye is -the wine glass sits slightly to the viewers right and this wouldn''t matter much but the candles are there as a judging point', '2005-12-17 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958088, 268059, 16241, '<td valign="top">thats nice!</td>', 'thats nice!', '2005-12-17 10:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958089, 268297, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2005-12-17 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958097, 268055, 16241, '<td valign="top">this should do well, nice shadows</td>', 'this should do well, nice shadows', '2005-12-17 11:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958098, 268137, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is a very noisy shot, taking it to B&amp;W may have enhanced the image and brought the lighting out just as well as the color version<br/> <br/>also as far as model chords go pick a different shape, maybe use the open D chord shape and just move it up the neck....its doesn''t  need to soud good but it makes a better more natural pose chord.....the less fingers u have on the neck the less cluttered the image the better, cleaner and more realstic the image. GL (glad to see some1 plays finger style)</td>', 'this is a very noisy shot, taking it to B&W may have enhanced the image and brought the lighting out just as well as the color version also as far as model chords go pick a different shape, maybe use the open D chord shape and just move it up the neck....its doesn''t  need to soud good but it makes a better more natural pose chord.....the less fingers u have on the neck the less cluttered the image the better, cleaner and more realstic the image. GL (glad to see some1 plays finger style)', '2005-12-17 11:05:41.000000', NULL, 1);
