(1958124, 267566, 40484, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition. I feel that a more subdued lighting with more shadows would have been more effective to convey the atmosphere of "The Raven".  Perhaps you could try adjusting the contrat level or using curves to increase the contrasts to make the shadows pop.</td>', 'Good idea and composition. I feel that a more subdued lighting with more shadows would have been more effective to convey the atmosphere of "The Raven".  Perhaps you could try adjusting the contrat level or using curves to increase the contrasts to make the shadows pop.', '2005-12-17 11:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958171, 266863, 24503, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl. Nice composition, but IMO the image is a little bit "washed". Maybe you can achieve a most contrasted image using levels. Keep shooting.</td>', 'Pretty girl. Nice composition, but IMO the image is a little bit "washed". Maybe you can achieve a most contrasted image using levels. Keep shooting.', '2005-12-17 11:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
