(1958348, 266325, 22379, '<td valign="top">the folds of the blanket give the impression that someone is holding the saucer through the blanket to hide the band. There is no hnit that there is tea, just that there is a cup  - you needed more light in the cup (this was not a single light souce challenge and nothing wrong with using lights other than candles).</td>', 'the folds of the blanket give the impression that someone is holding the saucer through the blanket to hide the band. There is no hnit that there is tea, just that there is a cup  - you needed more light in the cup (this was not a single light souce challenge and nothing wrong with using lights other than candles).', '2005-12-17 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
