(1958982, 267104, 40484, '<td valign="top">I like the blur/halo around the wine glass, it gives it an added dimension. I don''t like the blur around the candles though, it just doesn''t appeal to may taste.</td>', 'I like the blur/halo around the wine glass, it gives it an added dimension. I don''t like the blur around the candles though, it just doesn''t appeal to may taste.', '2005-12-17 19:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958994, 268131, 40484, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, difficult to pull off.  The black wicks of the burning candles draw your eye even though it is difficult to see the flame against the white background.  I think you meant the candles to represent an advent wreath so I hope I understood part of what you were trying to portray.</td>', 'Interesting concept, difficult to pull off.  The black wicks of the burning candles draw your eye even though it is difficult to see the flame against the white background.  I think you meant the candles to represent an advent wreath so I hope I understood part of what you were trying to portray.', '2005-12-17 19:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1959004, 266870, 40484, '<td valign="top">Nice clear focus and beautiful colours. Too much going on, IMO.  Perhaps removing one or both of the Christmas balls would give a clearer focal point. The red candle on the right also has a distracting lean to it that a slight rotation of the shot may have helped.</td>', 'Nice clear focus and beautiful colours. Too much going on, IMO.  Perhaps removing one or both of the Christmas balls would give a clearer focal point. The red candle on the right also has a distracting lean to it that a slight rotation of the shot may have helped.', '2005-12-17 19:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1959010, 266853, 40484, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot! I love the way you have the candle lines leading the eye into the shot and the dark of the hillside balancing the brightness of the path.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot! I love the way you have the candle lines leading the eye into the shot and the dark of the hillside balancing the brightness of the path.', '2005-12-17 19:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
