(1959384, 268253, 48456, '<td valign="top">though it slal really light i feel liek its a dark photo, perhaps the flame inverses everything. one has a tendency to see a candle light and feel conforted by it, this does the compelte opposite which may be even better in reminding us its real properties. its cool. perhaps if you had used a different candle color ?</td>', 'though it slal really light i feel liek its a dark photo, perhaps the flame inverses everything. one has a tendency to see a candle light and feel conforted by it, this does the compelte opposite which may be even better in reminding us its real properties. its cool. perhaps if you had used a different candle color ?', '2005-12-17 23:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
