(1959477, 267445, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=0 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>I like the red glow on the face but the candle appears to be a little out of focus, that could be just because of the exposure but not sure.  Good luck.<br/></td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=0 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1  I like the red glow on the face but the candle appears to be a little out of focus, that could be just because of the exposure but not sure.  Good luck.', '2005-12-18 00:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1959484, 268218, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>Love the concept of this image and I think you pulled most of it off quite nicely.  I like the lighting and can get an instant feel for what it is, even without looking at the title but there is something bothering me with the back of his head.  I can''t tell if that is part of his hat or what.  Maybe less lighting there would help hide it, not sure.  Great image all in all, good luck.<br/></td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=1  Love the concept of this image and I think you pulled most of it off quite nicely.  I like the lighting and can get an instant feel for what it is, even without looking at the title but there is something bothering me with the back of his head.  I can''t tell if that is part of his hat or what.  Maybe less lighting there would help hide it, not sure.  Great image all in all, good luck.', '2005-12-18 00:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1959489, 268298, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=2<br/> <br/>Lovely image.  Most have probably said there is no proof of the candle here but I really like the image.  The lighting is a little hot on the left side of the blub but not a bother.  I like that I can see some of the table grain, really nice.  The simple white frame helps keep your eyes in the image and complements it nicely.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=2 Lovely image.  Most have probably said there is no proof of the candle here but I really like the image.  The lighting is a little hot on the left side of the blub but not a bother.  I like that I can see some of the table grain, really nice.  The simple white frame helps keep your eyes in the image and complements it nicely.  Good luck.', '2005-12-18 00:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1959490, 265718, 42135, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection of the child! The background looks just a bit out of place for this but nice dof.</td>', 'Nice reflection of the child! The background looks just a bit out of place for this but nice dof.', '2005-12-18 00:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
