(1960877, 267314, 22379, '<td valign="top">The area surrounding the flame is teo blown out. You had he start of a nice idea here - the light shining through the  flowers - it would have ben nice (and had more impact) if you had followed through with that idea rather than just taking a picture of the candle.</td>', 'The area surrounding the flame is teo blown out. You had he start of a nice idea here - the light shining through the  flowers - it would have ben nice (and had more impact) if you had followed through with that idea rather than just taking a picture of the candle.', '2005-12-18 20:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960880, 267104, 22379, '<td valign="top">The glow of the glass is very nice - however the white ones are too blurry and distract from the effect in the glass. I would have scotred this image higher withough that addition.</td>', 'The glow of the glass is very nice - however the white ones are too blurry and distract from the effect in the glass. I would have scotred this image higher withough that addition.', '2005-12-18 20:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960904, 267175, 22379, '<td valign="top">to me this is more of a family snap that fit the challenge than an image intended for the challenge. The couple could probably really like this image. Cropping out the paper would have made the image appear more composed. For me the candles are a distraction from the couple rather than a source of impact.</td>', 'to me this is more of a family snap that fit the challenge than an image intended for the challenge. The couple could probably really like this image. Cropping out the paper would have made the image appear more composed. For me the candles are a distraction from the couple rather than a source of impact.', '2005-12-18 20:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960906, 267148, 38464, '<td valign="top">Concept is great... only thing I would change is to use a red candle and maybe hold it higher a little bit, so that the shadow on the right is not so ''shadowy''. ;-)</td>', 'Concept is great... only thing I would change is to use a red candle and maybe hold it higher a little bit, so that the shadow on the right is not so ''shadowy''. ;-)', '2005-12-18 20:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960910, 268262, 22379, '<td valign="top">The angle chosen here is not particularly complimentary to the scene - but i guess the garland would have hidden the statues at any other angle. This image would have benifited with some addition light to sharpen the focus. May have been stronger if jesus was turned a bit more towwards the camera.</td>', 'The angle chosen here is not particularly complimentary to the scene - but i guess the garland would have hidden the statues at any other angle. This image would have benifited with some addition light to sharpen the focus. May have been stronger if jesus was turned a bit more towwards the camera.', '2005-12-18 20:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960914, 267901, 38464, '<td valign="top">Very romantic!  Love the reflections of the floating candles, it helps to set it off so there is not this big dark space. That you have all that room around your tub... well... I''m jealous!! :-)</td>', 'Very romantic!  Love the reflections of the floating candles, it helps to set it off so there is not this big dark space. That you have all that room around your tub... well... I''m jealous!! :-)', '2005-12-18 20:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960915, 268169, 22379, '<td valign="top">the light on the girl is good, and the focus on her strong - fot that reason i will bump this up, however, the candle is incredibly blown out and the light around the flame looks faked.</td>', 'the light on the girl is good, and the focus on her strong - fot that reason i will bump this up, however, the candle is incredibly blown out and the light around the flame looks faked.', '2005-12-18 20:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960917, 268301, 38464, '<td valign="top">Concept  is nice,  would liked to have seen the candle a little more straight though. I keep looking at it and praying it doesn''t fall over. ;-)</td>', 'Concept  is nice,  would liked to have seen the candle a little more straight though. I keep looking at it and praying it doesn''t fall over. ;-)', '2005-12-18 20:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960921, 267885, 22379, '<td valign="top">Little too dark here. Looks like it might have been a fun family snap if the light was better. Whatever is happening it is clear that the central model is having fun.</td>', 'Little too dark here. Looks like it might have been a fun family snap if the light was better. Whatever is happening it is clear that the central model is having fun.', '2005-12-18 20:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960924, 267947, 38464, '<td valign="top">I like it... different, but that''s not a bad thing. That you turned it sideways gives pause for a hmmmm......  I think had it been left horizontal it would probably not caught my as quick. Love the little bubbles within that are reflected by the candle. I also keep waiting for them to roll off the table...  then we could hear... ''I''ve lost my marbles!'' :-)</td>', 'I like it... different, but that''s not a bad thing. That you turned it sideways gives pause for a hmmmm......  I think had it been left horizontal it would probably not caught my as quick. Love the little bubbles within that are reflected by the candle. I also keep waiting for them to roll off the table...  then we could hear... ''I''ve lost my marbles!'' :-)', '2005-12-18 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960927, 268229, 22379, '<td valign="top">try to aim for 640 pxl as the largest dimension. Are these candles? Maybe they are laying down, but then why would the glow be even throughout. The blue cast is distracting - if you have photoshop, try using curves with the dark eyedropper tool arounf the blue area to make the dark background more even.</td>', 'try to aim for 640 pxl as the largest dimension. Are these candles? Maybe they are laying down, but then why would the glow be even throughout. The blue cast is distracting - if you have photoshop, try using curves with the dark eyedropper tool arounf the blue area to make the dark background more even.', '2005-12-18 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960930, 268125, 22379, '<td valign="top">this probably would have done well in the holiday challenge. I could have done without the hooks. I am not sure why i have this scored so low, it is going up ;)</td>', 'this probably would have done well in the holiday challenge. I could have done without the hooks. I am not sure why i have this scored so low, it is going up ;)', '2005-12-18 20:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960937, 266949, 22379, '<td valign="top">this image would have have been multitudes better if you had used a light source to "paint" in some details on the  red dress(?) nightgown(?) whatever it is - so we could tell what it was. This wasn''t a single light source challenge, and the modd would have remained strong with the candles on the hardwood floor.</td>', 'this image would have have been multitudes better if you had used a light source to "paint" in some details on the  red dress(?) nightgown(?) whatever it is - so we could tell what it was. This wasn''t a single light source challenge, and the modd would have remained strong with the candles on the hardwood floor.', '2005-12-18 20:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960940, 266717, 38464, '<td valign="top">Nostalgic... the weathered books, inking jar, old time glasses and that candle holder... just makes me want to curl up with a Charles Dickens book or something. And the tilding candle just adds to it here. I think if it were perfectly straight, in this setting, it wouldn''t look right.</td>', 'Nostalgic... the weathered books, inking jar, old time glasses and that candle holder... just makes me want to curl up with a Charles Dickens book or something. And the tilding candle just adds to it here. I think if it were perfectly straight, in this setting, it wouldn''t look right.', '2005-12-18 21:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960945, 268151, 22379, '<td valign="top">cropping off the top so we could just see the rows of candle holders and not the distracting  background behind would have made for a more appealing image. A little lower might have shown more glows through the crosses also.</td>', 'cropping off the top so we could just see the rows of candle holders and not the distracting  background behind would have made for a more appealing image. A little lower might have shown more glows through the crosses also.', '2005-12-18 21:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960952, 268218, 38464, '<td valign="top">I like the concept - Santa''s apprentice searching the globe. I''m not sure though that I believe the glow is from a candle. Just doesn''t have (for me) the ''warmth'' of candlelight. Unless it is very big candle.  As I said though, except for the harsh glow, I like it. (Afterthought--- would like to see it without the dark shadow above the cap.)</td>', 'I like the concept - Santa''s apprentice searching the globe. I''m not sure though that I believe the glow is from a candle. Just doesn''t have (for me) the ''warmth'' of candlelight. Unless it is very big candle.  As I said though, except for the harsh glow, I like it. (Afterthought--- would like to see it without the dark shadow above the cap.)', '2005-12-18 21:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960955, 266888, 22379, '<td valign="top">i would have liked to have seen a little more of the flame since you decided to make the candle your subject rather than using candlelight to create impact. The image would have been more interesting if you had allowed the candle to burn longer so there were some intriging waxdrip patterns down the candle.</td>', 'i would have liked to have seen a little more of the flame since you decided to make the candle your subject rather than using candlelight to create impact. The image would have been more interesting if you had allowed the candle to burn longer so there were some intriging waxdrip patterns down the candle.', '2005-12-18 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960962, 267950, 22379, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better with a plain dark background rather than the tree lights showing. That way the shooting star would have pulled out from the page with a little more oomh.</td>', 'I would have liked this better with a plain dark background rather than the tree lights showing. That way the shooting star would have pulled out from the page with a little more oomh.', '2005-12-18 21:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960965, 267147, 38464, '<td valign="top">This one just scares the bejeebies outta me! *lol* But, going past my beliefs and seeing the image as an image and not something scarey...   dead on with focus on the candle, flame and wick! And that you took the time to line it up the pendant, gives added points. And even though the face and eyes are not in focus, you are automatically drawn to them, which in turn pulls you back to the pendant, which moves you back to the candle and flame.  I see an extra bible verse for me tonight. ;-)</td>', 'This one just scares the bejeebies outta me! *lol* But, going past my beliefs and seeing the image as an image and not something scarey...   dead on with focus on the candle, flame and wick! And that you took the time to line it up the pendant, gives added points. And even though the face and eyes are not in focus, you are automatically drawn to them, which in turn pulls you back to the pendant, which moves you back to the candle and flame.  I see an extra bible verse for me tonight. ;-)', '2005-12-18 21:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960967, 266313, 22379, '<td valign="top">Always be aware of distracting objects that may apear i the background of your photo. It is almost always easier to move them than to edit them out. Adding some blue food colouring to the water might have made this image more interesting.</td>', 'Always be aware of distracting objects that may apear i the background of your photo. It is almost always easier to move them than to edit them out. Adding some blue food colouring to the water might have made this image more interesting.', '2005-12-18 21:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960971, 268173, 10413, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Good luck.', '2005-12-18 21:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960972, 267762, 10413, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this.  Interested in seeing how it was done.</td>', 'Love the colors in this.  Interested in seeing how it was done.', '2005-12-18 21:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960973, 267537, 10413, '<td valign="top">So inviting.</td>', 'So inviting.', '2005-12-18 21:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960974, 268253, 22379, '<td valign="top">although this is nicely done, i am not a big fan of inverting an image purely to make it look more interesting.  I do not find the candlight to have any impact in this image, it just "is".</td>', 'although this is nicely done, i am not a big fan of inverting an image purely to make it look more interesting.  I do not find the candlight to have any impact in this image, it just "is".', '2005-12-18 21:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960975, 268092, 38464, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s just my screen.. I see what looks like little dots everywhere. :-D Going past that though, great concept, however... personally, I would have liked to have seen something on the dinnerware besides the clothes and nice clean dinnerware. Kind of like... in the middle of eating when passions take hold..  But, that''s just me. (Wonders why I don''t think of great ideas while challenges are going?!?!)  :-)</td>', 'Not sure if it''s just my screen.. I see what looks like little dots everywhere. :-D Going past that though, great concept, however... personally, I would have liked to have seen something on the dinnerware besides the clothes and nice clean dinnerware. Kind of like... in the middle of eating when passions take hold..  But, that''s just me. (Wonders why I don''t think of great ideas while challenges are going?!?!)  :-)', '2005-12-18 21:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960976, 266651, 10413, '<td valign="top">Yum looks delicious.  I think the frame takes away from the shot though.</td>', 'Yum looks delicious.  I think the frame takes away from the shot though.', '2005-12-18 21:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960985, 266894, 10413, '<td valign="top">Took a second look to see what the candle was.  I thought it was just a melted candle the first time. Nice shot.</td>', 'Took a second look to see what the candle was.  I thought it was just a melted candle the first time. Nice shot.', '2005-12-18 21:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960987, 268127, 22379, '<td valign="top">This is more of a picture of a candle than impact from the light. The shape is nice, good focus. The flame looks pretty sad.</td>', 'This is more of a picture of a candle than impact from the light. The shape is nice, good focus. The flame looks pretty sad.', '2005-12-18 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960988, 268160, 10413, '<td valign="top">Very nice. One of my all time favorite singers and song too.  Such a shame his life was cut so short.</td>', 'Very nice. One of my all time favorite singers and song too.  Such a shame his life was cut so short.', '2005-12-18 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960990, 266853, 11487, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  The luminaries draw you in.</td>', 'Very nice effect.  The luminaries draw you in.', '2005-12-18 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960992, 268055, 10413, '<td valign="top">That made for a great shadow on the wall.</td>', 'That made for a great shadow on the wall.', '2005-12-18 21:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960996, 268235, 38464, '<td valign="top">You sure know how to make my mouth water! I''ve actually done this many-a-time, just so I could have a roasted marshie. :-) The crispier on the outside, the gooier on the inside... YUM!  Love that you captured on the marshmallow the red hots, as we call them.  Hmmm.. I have toothpicks, marshmallows and tea lights.. I so know what I''m gonna do. :-D</td>', 'You sure know how to make my mouth water! I''ve actually done this many-a-time, just so I could have a roasted marshie. :-) The crispier on the outside, the gooier on the inside... YUM!  Love that you captured on the marshmallow the red hots, as we call them.  Hmmm.. I have toothpicks, marshmallows and tea lights.. I so know what I''m gonna do. :-D', '2005-12-18 21:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960997, 268063, 11487, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Nice composition and color.  Would like to have seen more graduation between the blue and black.</td>', 'Great idea.  Nice composition and color.  Would like to have seen more graduation between the blue and black.', '2005-12-18 21:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961000, 268063, 10413, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Love the shade of blue in it.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Love the shade of blue in it.', '2005-12-18 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961001, 268137, 22379, '<td valign="top">needed a little more light - perhaps a collection of candles behind him to backlight his face a little. One inside the guitar would have been cool - but yeh, wouldnt want to ruin the guitar!</td>', 'needed a little more light - perhaps a collection of candles behind him to backlight his face a little. One inside the guitar would have been cool - but yeh, wouldnt want to ruin the guitar!', '2005-12-18 21:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961002, 267175, 1, '<td valign="top">I think it''d be a lot better if the candles spanned the whole bottom of the image.  Otherwise, great exposure.</td>', 'I think it''d be a lot better if the candles spanned the whole bottom of the image.  Otherwise, great exposure.', '2005-12-18 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961004, 268055, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the shadows.  Composition works well.  The color is great.</td>', 'Nice effect with the shadows.  Composition works well.  The color is great.', '2005-12-18 21:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961007, 266326, 22379, '<td valign="top">would have been nice if the lamp was hanging rather than seated on a table. Your candle is a little lopsidded.</td>', 'would have been nice if the lamp was hanging rather than seated on a table. Your candle is a little lopsidded.', '2005-12-18 21:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961008, 267871, 38464, '<td valign="top">Would love to know the details behind this one. It''s unique compared to what the other entries. Perspective is great, would not have had as much ''punch'' if taken from different angle, well.. maybe the other side of candle. ;-) And it even looks like ''bullet'' is in focus.  (Is it bullet or really really small pencil?) Very cool idea.</td>', 'Would love to know the details behind this one. It''s unique compared to what the other entries. Perspective is great, would not have had as much ''punch'' if taken from different angle, well.. maybe the other side of candle. ;-) And it even looks like ''bullet'' is in focus.  (Is it bullet or really really small pencil?) Very cool idea.', '2005-12-18 21:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961009, 267049, 10413, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the colors and shadows on the face. You have beautiful eyes. :)</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the colors and shadows on the face. You have beautiful eyes. :)', '2005-12-18 21:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961010, 267992, 11487, '<td valign="top">I like the way the candles lead you up the stairs.  Nice composition.  The light at the lower left corner is a little distracting to me.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the way the candles lead you up the stairs.  Nice composition.  The light at the lower left corner is a little distracting to me.  Nice job.', '2005-12-18 21:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961017, 268230, 22379, '<td valign="top">there is a lot going on to the left and nothing to the right - why not crop that right side off - or move to include more of the vase?<br/></td>', 'there is a lot going on to the left and nothing to the right - why not crop that right side off - or move to include more of the vase?', '2005-12-18 21:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961018, 268131, 11487, '<td valign="top">White on white is difficult to shoot.  More contrast needed, especially for the flames.  Nice idea.</td>', 'White on white is difficult to shoot.  More contrast needed, especially for the flames.  Nice idea.', '2005-12-18 21:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961021, 268214, 22379, '<td valign="top">This angle of light is not complimentary to a human. More light was needed to help the camera focus, even if you removed the light after focusing to improve the overall impact of the image.</td>', 'This angle of light is not complimentary to a human. More light was needed to help the camera focus, even if you removed the light after focusing to improve the overall impact of the image.', '2005-12-18 21:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961028, 267737, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The candles lead you into the image.  I think the graininess of the background works well.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The candles lead you into the image.  I think the graininess of the background works well.', '2005-12-18 21:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961032, 267680, 22379, '<td valign="top">this appears to be fairly snap-shotty. Nothing in this image grabs me.</td>', 'this appears to be fairly snap-shotty. Nothing in this image grabs me.', '2005-12-18 21:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961036, 267483, 11487, '<td valign="top">DOF is works well.  Composition is interesting.  I like the rhythm of the candles.</td>', 'DOF is works well.  Composition is interesting.  I like the rhythm of the candles.', '2005-12-18 21:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961047, 266717, 22379, '<td valign="top">i really like the underlying story portaied here - i do which you had used a bit more light on the books so the image would have been focused throughtout insead of just the candle being crisp. Bumping up.</td>', 'i really like the underlying story portaied here - i do which you had used a bit more light on the books so the image would have been focused throughtout insead of just the candle being crisp. Bumping up.', '2005-12-18 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961053, 267947, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I would have liked to seen this without the angle and more exaggeration of the perspective.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I would have liked to seen this without the angle and more exaggeration of the perspective.', '2005-12-18 21:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961057, 265682, 22379, '<td valign="top">the photographers feet were possibly not the most visually appealing addition to thisimage.</td>', 'the photographers feet were possibly not the most visually appealing addition to thisimage.', '2005-12-18 21:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961066, 266112, 22379, '<td valign="top">the image is sharp, i will give you that but "five candles in a box" pretty much says it all. I almost wonder if a photo needed to follow. Composition wise, i think it would have been stronger if you cropped some of the black from the bottom so the candles werent smack in the center of the image.</td>', 'the image is sharp, i will give you that but "five candles in a box" pretty much says it all. I almost wonder if a photo needed to follow. Composition wise, i think it would have been stronger if you cropped some of the black from the bottom so the candles werent smack in the center of the image.', '2005-12-18 21:46:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1961068, 268206, 11487, '<td valign="top">This image draws you in to know more of the story.  I like the way you hid the reader''s face from view.</td>', 'This image draws you in to know more of the story.  I like the way you hid the reader''s face from view.', '2005-12-18 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961077, 267901, 11487, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo for a life style magazine.  Tilt of perspective to get the grout lines parallel with the edge would have helped.</td>', 'Looks like a photo for a life style magazine.  Tilt of perspective to get the grout lines parallel with the edge would have helped.', '2005-12-18 21:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961080, 268278, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and isolation of the subject.</td>', 'Nice composition and isolation of the subject.', '2005-12-18 21:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961086, 268144, 22379, '<td valign="top">the red and green thing in the background is quite distracting - this could have been cloned out. The blow out around the flame is also quite harsh. I am curious as to why there are 2 candle holders but only one candle.</td>', 'the red and green thing in the background is quite distracting - this could have been cloned out. The blow out around the flame is also quite harsh. I am curious as to why there are 2 candle holders but only one candle.', '2005-12-18 21:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961091, 268151, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lines.  May be cropping out the background would have made this a stronger image.</td>', 'Nice composition and lines.  May be cropping out the background would have made this a stronger image.', '2005-12-18 21:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961092, 268029, 22379, '<td valign="top">so much motion blur? A little focus somewhere would have been nice - at least so we could tell the subject matter.</td>', 'so much motion blur? A little focus somewhere would have been nice - at least so we could tell the subject matter.', '2005-12-18 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961103, 267999, 11487, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and shadows, contrast works well.  Somebody get her a light and mop.</td>', 'Good use of light and shadows, contrast works well.  Somebody get her a light and mop.', '2005-12-18 21:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961105, 267926, 38464, '<td valign="top">Liked how you kept the fruit theme flowing.... from the platter to the candle, or is that from the candle to the platter? ;-) Looks yummy!</td>', 'Liked how you kept the fruit theme flowing.... from the platter to the candle, or is that from the candle to the platter? ;-) Looks yummy!', '2005-12-18 21:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961123, 267049, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice focus of light on her eye.   A little more light a her other eye would have helped.  May be moving the candle more towards the center and out of frame would have given more light to both eyes with less on her right eye.  The candle and flame are too distracting.</td>', 'Nice focus of light on her eye.   A little more light a her other eye would have helped.  May be moving the candle more towards the center and out of frame would have given more light to both eyes with less on her right eye.  The candle and flame are too distracting.', '2005-12-18 22:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961140, 267187, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup.  The different colors emphasize the heat.  Composition works well.</td>', 'Nice closeup.  The different colors emphasize the heat.  Composition works well.', '2005-12-18 22:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961168, 267255, 11487, '<td valign="top">Better focus on the flames might have made this a stronger image.  Less foreground would help.  The red border is too heavy.  I like the lines created by the rythm of candles.</td>', 'Better focus on the flames might have made this a stronger image.  Less foreground would help.  The red border is too heavy.  I like the lines created by the rythm of candles.', '2005-12-18 22:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961189, 266563, 29490, '<td valign="top">A soni if I ever saw one.  Great focus and curves.  Beautiful flames.</td>', 'A soni if I ever saw one.  Great focus and curves.  Beautiful flames.', '2005-12-18 22:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961219, 267688, 22379, '<td valign="top">There is not enough light in the photo to illuminate the thing in the middle. It seems that the focus might be on the thing, so it is ashame we cannot see it.</td>', 'There is not enough light in the photo to illuminate the thing in the middle. It seems that the focus might be on the thing, so it is ashame we cannot see it.', '2005-12-18 22:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961265, 266996, 24940, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  However, IMO, one should always strive to avoid the "up-the-nose" shot.  Foreground is a bit noisy - maye a few more candles (in the fill &amp; main light positions) and/or some bounce cards would help, as would a camera angle more perpendicular to the tub.</td>', 'Nice concept.  However, IMO, one should always strive to avoid the "up-the-nose" shot.  Foreground is a bit noisy - maye a few more candles (in the fill & main light positions) and/or some bounce cards would help, as would a camera angle more perpendicular to the tub.', '2005-12-18 22:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961274, 268092, 24940, '<td valign="top">Yeah, a little extra fiber is good for ya!  ;)<br/>Maybe bring the candle a bit more into the frame.  Cool idea!</td>', 'Yeah, a little extra fiber is good for ya!  ;)Maybe bring the candle a bit more into the frame.  Cool idea!', '2005-12-18 22:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961276, 267255, 24940, '<td valign="top">Red border line is too thick.  Maybe crop a bit more off the botom (&amp; add it to the top).</td>', 'Red border line is too thick.  Maybe crop a bit more off the botom (& add it to the top).', '2005-12-18 22:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961430, 267337, 48560, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh, and like the softness of the light on the child to the left.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-30 03:07:53.</i></td>', 'Nice bokeh, and like the softness of the light on the child to the left.', '2005-12-18 23:42:57.000000', '2005-12-30 03:07:53.000000', 1),
(1961457, 268119, 5885, '<td valign="top">Highly under-rated... It is a great photo, Angela .</td>', 'Highly under-rated... It is a great photo, Angela .', '2005-12-19 00:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961459, 268063, 13077, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue. Really cool shot</td>', 'Congrats on the blue. Really cool shot', '2005-12-19 00:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961465, 267682, 27812, '<td valign="top">another great pic... well planned and executed, no substitute for real talent. well done.</td>', 'another great pic... well planned and executed, no substitute for real talent. well done.', '2005-12-19 00:22:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961468, 268063, 42984, '<td valign="top">We would appreciate you sharing your Photographer''s Comments with the community since they took the time and trouble to vote and comment on your entry<br/> <br/>Brett</td>', 'We would appreciate you sharing your Photographer''s Comments with the community since they took the time and trouble to vote and comment on your entry Brett', '2005-12-19 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961477, 266929, 29906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Dan, should''ve scored higher if not for the 2''s and 3''s, it still puzzles me how one can vote this shot a 2 or a 3..</td>', 'Nice shot Dan, should''ve scored higher if not for the 2''s and 3''s, it still puzzles me how one can vote this shot a 2 or a 3..', '2005-12-19 00:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961499, 268063, 40718, '<td valign="top">Called it...congrats soup.  It sure did deserve the blue...</td>', 'Called it...congrats soup.  It sure did deserve the blue...', '2005-12-19 00:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961522, 268119, 714, '<td valign="top">yup, I agree, fotomann!  Excellent lighting and very good use of camera skills!</td>', 'yup, I agree, fotomann!  Excellent lighting and very good use of camera skills!', '2005-12-19 00:34:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961529, 268063, 37961, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. Very well earned.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. Very well earned.', '2005-12-19 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961531, 268055, 37961, '<td valign="top">Strange set up, but surprisingly effective. Congrats on the ribbon. Enjoy!</td>', 'Strange set up, but surprisingly effective. Congrats on the ribbon. Enjoy!', '2005-12-19 00:36:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961549, 267187, 14386, '<td valign="top">Finally!  Hindi na kailangan ang tulong ko.  This is awesome.  Like the details.  Mabuhay Pinoy!<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'Finally!  Hindi na kailangan ang tulong ko.  This is awesome.  Like the details.  Mabuhay Pinoy! Manny', '2005-12-19 00:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961550, 268063, 3724, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KiwiPix:</b></div><hr/><i>.........comment on your entry<br/> <br/>Brett </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t mind silence.........  Congratulations soup, beautiful work.</td>', 'Originally posted by KiwiPix:.........comment on your entry Brett   I don''t mind silence.........  Congratulations soup, beautiful work.', '2005-12-19 00:39:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961562, 268063, 35321, '<td valign="top">An outstanding minimalist study--congratulations on the blue!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-19 00:47:06.</i></td>', 'An outstanding minimalist study--congratulations on the blue!', '2005-12-19 00:43:52.000000', '2005-12-19 00:47:06.000000', 0),
(1961565, 268278, 39429, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a top score!  Way to go.  It''s beautiful.<br/>Becky</td>', 'Congratulations on a top score!  Way to go.  It''s beautiful.Becky', '2005-12-19 00:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961602, 267187, 35321, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  I love the choice of candle color to match the flame and the detail in the wick.  Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Congratulations!  I love the choice of candle color to match the flame and the detail in the wick.  Beautiful composition.', '2005-12-19 00:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961607, 268063, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well it''s about time... you were long overdue! Clean and elegant photos R You, and this one''s no exception. Congrats on the bluey!</td>', 'Well it''s about time... you were long overdue! Clean and elegant photos R You, and this one''s no exception. Congrats on the bluey!', '2005-12-19 00:56:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961626, 268063, 714, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.  Love the blue tones..very relaxing!  Congrats!</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.  Love the blue tones..very relaxing!  Congrats!', '2005-12-19 00:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961698, 268297, 43404, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  I love this one. ~Erin</td>', 'Congrats!  I love this one. ~Erin', '2005-12-19 01:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961742, 268055, 48845, '<td valign="top">WOW. Very creative.</td>', 'WOW. Very creative.', '2005-12-19 01:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961747, 268281, 35786, '<td valign="top">well- I think it needs more compositionally. it''s such an indspiring background but the candles cover them up. they need to add, not diminish. I think if you had them set up below the stained glass it might have worked better for ya. well- no zeros! hey I always seem to have a few of those!!! I like the idea a lot :0)</td>', 'well- I think it needs more compositionally. it''s such an indspiring background but the candles cover them up. they need to add, not diminish. I think if you had them set up below the stained glass it might have worked better for ya. well- no zeros! hey I always seem to have a few of those!!! I like the idea a lot :0)', '2005-12-19 01:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961768, 268297, 15711, '<td valign="top">Heh congrats on the high finish. I really like this alot.</td>', 'Heh congrats on the high finish. I really like this alot.', '2005-12-19 01:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1961784, 267682, 16241, '<td valign="top">great shot, thought it would finish higher :(</td>', 'great shot, thought it would finish higher :(', '2005-12-19 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 0),
