(1961847, 267554, 42013, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote in this challenge but I think this shot was creative, well executed, and without your explanation of 2xRAW conversion would leave me wondering how you held the detail in the hilight areas and the shadows.  The green foliage is a perfect complement to the warm tones in the bagged candles.  If there is one suggestion I would make it would be to have placed another semi-obscured bag deeper into the BG to enhance the feeling of wanting to follow the lights to their begining.  <br/> <br/>Remember only you can prevent forest fires.</td>', 'Didn''t vote in this challenge but I think this shot was creative, well executed, and without your explanation of 2xRAW conversion would leave me wondering how you held the detail in the hilight areas and the shadows.  The green foliage is a perfect complement to the warm tones in the bagged candles.  If there is one suggestion I would make it would be to have placed another semi-obscured bag deeper into the BG to enhance the feeling of wanting to follow the lights to their begining.   Remember only you can prevent forest fires.', '2005-12-19 02:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
