(1962233, 268063, 11793, '<td valign="top">well to explain the constant use of blue...  i don''t have much of a studio space - the room i generally use has bright blue walls - so they tend to be in a lot of my shots during the colder months.<br/> <br/>i also like blue - and in visual arts - a blue BG tends to help make the subject POP off the page - so it isn''t all coincidence.<br/> <br/>my ''garbage'' entry had the blue wall too - but i destaurated blue &amp; cyan in that image ;}<br/> <br/>thanks again all !<br/> <br/></td>', 'well to explain the constant use of blue...  i don''t have much of a studio space - the room i generally use has bright blue walls - so they tend to be in a lot of my shots during the colder months. i also like blue - and in visual arts - a blue BG tends to help make the subject POP off the page - so it isn''t all coincidence. my ''garbage'' entry had the blue wall too - but i destaurated blue & cyan in that image ;} thanks again all ! ', '2005-12-19 09:32:36.000000', NULL, 0),
