(1962321, 268252, 34991, '<td valign="top">For those of you who commented on the lighting, this is a vastly different picture when viewed on a Mac than a PC. I optimized it for my PC, since I figured that''s what most people have, but it is very light when viewed on my Mac. It is supposed to be darker and more atmospheric. My monitors are all calibrated, but it''s just the difference between Mac and PC, CRT and LCD, I suppose.</td>', 'For those of you who commented on the lighting, this is a vastly different picture when viewed on a Mac than a PC. I optimized it for my PC, since I figured that''s what most people have, but it is very light when viewed on my Mac. It is supposed to be darker and more atmospheric. My monitors are all calibrated, but it''s just the difference between Mac and PC, CRT and LCD, I suppose.', '2005-12-19 10:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
