(1962730, 268134, 42013, '<td valign="top">First, great pun/play on words.  Just a week early I guess.  This image would have had more impact for me if there was just a touch of ambient lighting in the area surrounding the cross. Seems like this would have brought the overall tone of the picture a little which would make it stronger IMO. Maybe the same shot when late evening.<br/> <br/>LIke the composition and theme.</td>', 'First, great pun/play on words.  Just a week early I guess.  This image would have had more impact for me if there was just a touch of ambient lighting in the area surrounding the cross. Seems like this would have brought the overall tone of the picture a little which would make it stronger IMO. Maybe the same shot when late evening. LIke the composition and theme.', '2005-12-19 13:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1962789, 267554, 46448, '<td valign="top">I like it, I dunno if more candles would have helped or not, maybe more would have given it more depth. Maybe had it be a tad darker so you could see more reflections of light from the candles. This is a great shot technically, and maybe it kinda got looked over. But it is the top 25:)</td>', 'I like it, I dunno if more candles would have helped or not, maybe more would have given it more depth. Maybe had it be a tad darker so you could see more reflections of light from the candles. This is a great shot technically, and maybe it kinda got looked over. But it is the top 25:)', '2005-12-19 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1962816, 267554, 15711, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I didn''t rate it super high, but I do like the overall feel of it.  Soft and interesting. The luminaries are always quite appealing to me. I love your adventure story as much if not more than the photo itself!!  What we do to get a shot!! LOL</td>', 'Honestly, I didn''t rate it super high, but I do like the overall feel of it.  Soft and interesting. The luminaries are always quite appealing to me. I love your adventure story as much if not more than the photo itself!!  What we do to get a shot!! LOL', '2005-12-19 13:36:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1962819, 267483, 34459, '<td valign="top">This was my  favourite in this challenge; sorry it didn''t make top 10 at least. Well done, great image.</td>', 'This was my  favourite in this challenge; sorry it didn''t make top 10 at least. Well done, great image.', '2005-12-19 13:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1962826, 268281, 16106, '<td valign="top">I skipped this challenge, but in looking at the placments it seems  that simplicity was rewarded, and a total focus on the candle and the light it produces. Much of the impact of this shot is generated by the stained glass windows in contrast to the color of the candle and it''s warm light. I would bet it would have scored higher had you eliminated everything not lit by the candles.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-19 13:51:05.</i></td>', 'I skipped this challenge, but in looking at the placments it seems  that simplicity was rewarded, and a total focus on the candle and the light it produces. Much of the impact of this shot is generated by the stained glass windows in contrast to the color of the candle and it''s warm light. I would bet it would have scored higher had you eliminated everything not lit by the candles.', '2005-12-19 13:41:06.000000', '2005-12-19 13:51:05.000000', 0),
(1962829, 267187, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.<br/>Congrats on your first ribbon!! I am sure it is the first of many more to come.</td>', 'Beautiful image.Congrats on your first ribbon!! I am sure it is the first of many more to come.', '2005-12-19 13:42:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1962832, 267020, 34459, '<td valign="top">I really liked this &amp; gave it 9 - didn''t matter to me that the candle wasn''t in the shot, it looked like candlelight &amp; I loved the spooky horror feel, so well done.</td>', 'I really liked this & gave it 9 - didn''t matter to me that the candle wasn''t in the shot, it looked like candlelight & I loved the spooky horror feel, so well done.', '2005-12-19 13:42:57.000000', NULL, 0),
