(1962889, 268281, 3080, '<td valign="top">The photo itself seems to be lacking something that draws me in and holds my attention. Since I am not a religious person, I can share no personal feelings/opinions of the photo. The main subject seems to be the candles, which is good for the challenge, but the glass in the back is too out of focus to really add to the photo. If it had been in focus, then I think the attention would be taken away from the candles, so you made a good choice, but in this case, I find the glass more of a distraction. <br/>Focus on the candles is good. No complaints there. Color is good. Technically, it''s an alright photo, just not something I''m drawn to. <br/>Hope this helps. ~Heather~</td>', 'The photo itself seems to be lacking something that draws me in and holds my attention. Since I am not a religious person, I can share no personal feelings/opinions of the photo. The main subject seems to be the candles, which is good for the challenge, but the glass in the back is too out of focus to really add to the photo. If it had been in focus, then I think the attention would be taken away from the candles, so you made a good choice, but in this case, I find the glass more of a distraction. Focus on the candles is good. No complaints there. Color is good. Technically, it''s an alright photo, just not something I''m drawn to. Hope this helps. ~Heather~', '2005-12-19 14:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
