(1973803, 267871, 23294, '<td valign="top">great capture on the bullet!  The things in the shot other than the bullet look like they dould be a bit clearer, but i can only imagine how hard a shot like this is to get period.  The trail of the bullet is a great touch.</td>', 'great capture on the bullet!  The things in the shot other than the bullet look like they dould be a bit clearer, but i can only imagine how hard a shot like this is to get period.  The trail of the bullet is a great touch.', '2005-12-23 11:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
