(2332791, 267949, 34659, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 6 during the challenge.  Love the lighting and shadows.  The perspective is cool too.  The subject and backdrop are what are less interesting to me in this shot.  Could just be my personal taste, but it didn''t jump out and grab me.  Still an interesting and creative study.</td>', 'I scored this a 6 during the challenge.  Love the lighting and shadows.  The perspective is cool too.  The subject and backdrop are what are less interesting to me in this shot.  Could just be my personal taste, but it didn''t jump out and grab me.  Still an interesting and creative study.', '2006-04-21 13:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403856, 268144, 38496, '<td valign="top">Just read your photographers comments.  You never fail to make me laugh.  I love your sense of humor.  As for the picture... well, knowing the candle holders are shells gives it a wee bit more impact, maybe.  And the spot could be an enemy camp, if you have a really activie imagination...</td>', 'Just read your photographers comments.  You never fail to make me laugh.  I love your sense of humor.  As for the picture... well, knowing the candle holders are shells gives it a wee bit more impact, maybe.  And the spot could be an enemy camp, if you have a really activie imagination...', '2006-05-10 22:02:32.000000', NULL, 0),
